### Ringkasan Skor formulas

**Average per competency** (show empty string when no scores entered):
```
=IF(COUNTA(L{r1},L{r2},...,L{rn})=0,"",ROUND(AVERAGE(L{r1},L{r2},...,L{rn}),2))
```

**Interpretation** (show empty string when average is blank — auto-populates once scores are entered):
```
=IF(D{row}="","",IFS(
  D{row}>=4.5,"Transformatif — peserta menjadi role model",
  D{row}>=3.5,"Signifikan — pembelajaran terinternalisasi",
  D{row}>=2.5,"Moderat — butuh konsistensi dan follow-up",
  D{row}>=1.5,"Minimal — perlu pendampingan intensif",
  TRUE,"Tidak Ada Perubahan — evaluasi akar masalah"))
```

**CRITICAL**: Never use "—" as placeholder in interpretation. Always use `""` so the column appears empty until NILAI is filled.

