### Sheet 3 — "Contoh Pengisian"
Identical structure to Sheet 1, with:
- Pre-filled identity fields (fictional Indonesian names)
- Pre-filled NILAI column with realistic sample scores — mix of 2, 3, 4, 5 (never all the same value)
- Ringkasan formulas auto-calculate from sample scores

