## Quality checklist before saving
- [ ] Slide PDF visually inspected — brand colors extracted before code is written
- [ ] COMP_COLORS built from slide palette; fallback colors used for any shortfall
- [ ] Every colored cell: font color is WHITE on dark bg, BLACK on light bg — no exceptions
- [ ] Identity rows: label merged A:C (bg=EAECEE, black font), input field merged D:H (bg=YELLOW, black font, border)
- [ ] Score cells G–K: bg = SCORE_COLORS by column index — same across ALL rows, black font
- [ ] Competency cells (cols A, B, merged vertically): bg = COMP_COLORS[no]["light"], black font
- [ ] Summary competency rows: bg = COMP_COLORS[no]["light"] — matching rubric color, black font
- [ ] TEAL_DARK cells (title, col headers, OVERALL, section headers): white font
- [ ] Interpretation column: shows "" when NILAI empty, auto-fills via IFS formula when scores entered
- [ ] All NILAI cells: YELLOW bg, bold size 11, center-middle, thin border, black font
- [ ] Sheet 3 sample scores are varied (not all same value)
- [ ] No formula errors (#REF!, #DIV/0!, #VALUE!, #NAME?)
- [ ] All output text in Bahasa Indonesia
- [ ] Program name in rows 1–2 matches the actual training program
- [ ] Every item is directly traceable to session content — no generic filler items
